==Description==
The '''Korblox General''' was an enemy that appeared in [[The Classic Event]]. It had a high amount of health, though it was quite slow, only being faster than the [[Korblox Warrior (The Classic)|Korblox Warrior]] and [[Korblox Deathwalker (The Classic)|Korblox Deathwalker]]. On some waves, the '''Korblox General''' spawned as a [[Lead (Attribute)|Lead]] enemy.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox General''' was a giant skeleton that floated above the path. It had a grey skull with neon blue eyes. It also had neon blue arms and has no torso or legs. It wore grey pants, chestplate and shoulder-pads. It also had metal armbands and multiple blue spikes on its armor. 

==Strategy==
*Towers with good DPS, such as the [[Militant]], [[Minigunner]], [[Engineer]], [[Accelerator]] or [[Military Base]] are very effective against this.
**Do note that in [[Classic Castle]], it sometimes spawns as a lead enemy, meaning that your towers need lead detection to kill it.
*The [[Commander]] can be useful at boosting the firerate of your towers, if it is available.

